# 发布到 GitHub：client/、server/、tests/ 源码与测试，扩展源码，
# README、部署说明、许可证、.env.example，以及 server/docs/images/ 示例图。
# 只排除下面的本地数据、凭据和构建产物；不要使用 *.md / *.png 等全局规则。

# Python / test caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
*.egg-info/

# Virtual environments and dependency installs
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/

# Real configuration and credentials. Keep example templates publishable.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.ppk
*.key
*.keystore
id_rsa
id_ed25519

# Local databases, exports and logs
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.log
/client/data/
/server/data/

# Generated executables, packages and previews
build/
dist/
/app.ico
/client/app.ico
*.spec.bak
/artifacts/

# Local-only release/verification helpers. Runtime helpers inside client/ and
# server/ stay publishable. GitHub Actions were removed at the user's request.
/tools/
/.github/

# Working drafts; the maintained public instructions live in README files.
/WEBSITE_TRACKING_PLAN.md
/TRACKING_SETUP.md
/TRACKING_VERIFICATION.md
/BROWSER_EXTENSION_RELEASE.md
/BROWSER_EXTENSION_PRIVACY.md

# IDE / operating system
.vscode/
.idea/
.vs/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
